# Line endings, decided once.
#
# Without this the repo stored whatever each machine happened to write, and it
# cost real debugging twice: a file silently converted LF -> CRLF produced an
# 88-line diff that hid a three-line change, and an encoding round-trip
# destroyed 11 em dashes into U+FFFD across the CSS and two story files.
#
# `text=auto` normalises every text file to LF in the object store and checks
# it out in the platform's native form. Binary files are marked so git never
# touches their bytes.
#
# Adopting this renormalises existing blobs. Run `git add --renormalize .` once
# and commit it on its own, so the change is reviewable as what it is.
* text=auto

*.woff2 -text
*.jpg   -text
*.jpeg  -text
*.png   -text
*.ico   -text
*.webp  -text
*.mp4   -text
*.pdf   -text
